    <briefdescription>
<para>The Async Capabilites of the SDK. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The functions of the sdk with depend on either setting a state of the camera, or awaiting image data from the camera have async variations of themself. This includes most of the setter of the acqusition context as well as <ref refid="group__cuvis__acq_1ga1ca8cccaedc19f542c67805124fa271d" kindref="member">cuvis_acq_cont_capture</ref>.</para>
<para>The non async version of these functions execute the respective task and block as long as it takes. The async counterpart function call completes immediately and returns the handle to an aync result or async <ref refid="group__cuvis__mesu" kindref="compound">Measurement</ref>.</para>
<para>Theses async handles can then be used to check the state of the respective function call. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
